{"id":137533333619498,"name":"[EVENT X3 BETA] Mount Ducky","desc":"✨ Selamat datang di Mount Ducky! ✨\nPulau paling gokil tempat para bebek jadi penguasa dan penuh petualangan seru! 🦆🔥\n\nSiap-siap hadapin obby paling epik, penuh rintangan greget yang bikin deg-degan tapi nagih. 💥 Lompati celah-celah berbahaya, rasain tantangan naik gunungnya, dan buktiin kalau kamu bisa sampai ke puncak! 🏔️\n\nYang bikin makin rame, kamu bisa ditemenin sama anak-anak bebek imut yang bakal ngikutin kamu sepanjang perjalanan. 🐥✨ Jadi kamu ngga bakal sendirian lagi—rame-rame bareng bebek-bebek lucu bikin petualanganmu makin hidup!\n\nJangan lupa, ada banyak fitur yang bisa kamu temuin: \n\n- Carry ❤️‍🔥🐣\n- Speed coil 💥\n- Naik kapal bebek 🚤🐥\n- Freecam (Shift + C) 🎥📸\n- Terbang dengan glider ✈️\n- Animated following duck 🦆🦆\n- Duck costume, backpack, helmet, dan duck aura 🎒👒\n\nJadi, udah siap ngetes skill, ditemenin pasukan anak bebek, dan muncak di gunung penuh bebek? 🚀\nGaskeun, buktikan kalau kamu bisa taklukin semuanya! 💪✨","path":"/game/137533333619498-event-x3-beta-mount-ducky","slug":"137533333619498-event-x3-beta-mount-ducky","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d90f3cd94b2b8480921d451f6e1b8cf7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5928c33b787a6ec44ac413669947fa68/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":2667955,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-18T15:48:04.235Z","creator":{"name":"Yaryzz studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"EVENT-X3-BETA-Mount-Ducky-ArceusXArchive-59237","_id":"68f3b6b4df26206ffa8c1a95","title":"ArceusXArchive","game":{"_id":"68f30cbda4e2c159a5a7c19b","gameId":137533333619498,"name":"[EVENT X3 BETA] Mount Ducky","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-5928c33b787a6ec44ac413669947fa68-0aab7a1ff6b8.png","placeId":137533333619498},"features":"Feature\nAuto Checkpoints/Cp\nAnd More","tags":[],"script":"script